## Pin: B2 — instance method return is the DECLARED surface type,
## not auto-lifted. `Mutex.is_poisoned -> Int` stays Int per its lib
## decl; `Mutex.lock_raw -> MutexGuard[T]` returns a MutexGuard (not
## Int) per its lib decl. This pin guards against an over-eager lift
## that would auto-promote any `-> Int` instance method.
def main
  let m = Mutex.new(0)
  let poisoned = m.is_poisoned
  # If the lift over-promoted, `poisoned + 1` would fail because
  # `Mutex[Int]` doesn't implement +.
  let _ = poisoned + 1
end
